<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="BedBase">
    <defName>YJZ_Bedroom_SereneBed</defName>
    <label>云梦安神榻</label>
    <description>“神静而心和，心和而形全。”——《庄子》

道书《起居篇》记着上一代云间子的一场旧梦：她行过云上市，只记得一张安静得听不见风声的榻。现任云间子依图复其形，以床头灵珠梳理睡梦中的灵脉。

效果：高规格单人床，能够改善休息、疗养与手术条件。云间子在此睡眠时会缓慢恢复灵力，并不受琐碎声响打扰；真实危险仍会将她唤醒。</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yunjianzi/Buildings/Bedroom/SereneBed</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
      <shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType>
      <drawSize>(1.9,2.15)</drawSize>
      <damageData><rect>(0,0.05,1,1.95)</rect></damageData>
    </graphicData>
    <designationCategory>Ideology</designationCategory>
    <size>(1,2)</size>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <costList><Milira_SplendidSteel>90</Milira_SplendidSteel></costList>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>300</MaxHitPoints><Beauty>32</Beauty><WorkToBuild>1400</WorkToBuild>
      <Mass>18</Mass><Flammability>0</Flammability><Comfort>1.0</Comfort>
      <BedRestEffectiveness>1.4</BedRestEffectiveness><ImmunityGainSpeedFactor>1.3</ImmunityGainSpeedFactor>
      <MedicalTendQualityOffset>0.20</MedicalTendQualityOffset><SurgerySuccessChanceFactor>1.3</SurgerySuccessChanceFactor>
      <BirthRitualQualityOffset MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">7</BirthRitualQualityOffset>
    </statBases>
    <building>
      <paintable>false</paintable><bed_showSleeperBody>false</bed_showSleeperBody><bed_healPerDay>15</bed_healPerDay>
    </building>
    <fillPercent>0.4</fillPercent><pathCost>42</pathCost><staticSunShadowHeight>0.17</staticSunShadowHeight>
    <castEdgeShadows>true</castEdgeShadows><uiIconScale>0.88</uiIconScale><uiOrder>3970</uiOrder>
    <comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_AffectedByFacilities">
        <linkableFacilities>
          <li>YJZ_Bedroom_Nightstand</li><li>YJZ_Bedroom_Wardrobe</li>
          <li>VitalsMonitor</li><li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology">SleepAccelerator</li>
        </linkableFacilities>
      </li>
      <li Class="Yunjianzi.CompProperties_YunjianziSereneBed"><extraEnergyFractionPerSecond>0.0005</extraEnergyFractionPerSecond></li>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="FurnitureBase">
    <defName>YJZ_Bedroom_Nightstand</defName>
    <label>灵珠床头柜</label>
    <description>“虚室生白，吉祥止止。”——《庄子》

道书起居图中，八角柜面只置一珠，不陈杂物。微光恰好照见夜里伸手可及之处，也把床榻周围纷乱的灵路收束得更安稳。

效果：作为床头设施，小幅提高相邻床铺的舒适度；每张床只能连接一只。</description>
    <thingClass>Building</thingClass><designationCategory>Ideology</designationCategory>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yunjianzi/Buildings/Bedroom/Nightstand</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType><drawSize>(1.05,1.05)</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <size>(1,1)</size><altitudeLayer>Building</altitudeLayer><passability>PassThroughOnly</passability>
    <pathCost>30</pathCost><fillPercent>0.35</fillPercent><surfaceType>Item</surfaceType>
    <costList><Milira_SplendidSteel>35</Milira_SplendidSteel></costList>
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>180</MaxHitPoints><Beauty>12</Beauty><WorkToBuild>700</WorkToBuild><Mass>6</Mass><Flammability>0</Flammability></statBases>
    <placeWorkers><li>PlaceWorker_ShowFacilitiesConnections</li></placeWorkers>
    <comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Facility"><statOffsets><Comfort>0.05</Comfort></statOffsets><maxSimultaneous>1</maxSimultaneous><mustBePlacedAdjacentCardinalToBedHead>true</mustBePlacedAdjacentCardinalToBedHead></li>
    </comps>
    <uiOrder>3971</uiOrder>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="FurnitureBase">
    <defName>YJZ_Bedroom_Chair</defName>
    <label>云月玉椅</label>
    <description>“坐忘者，堕肢体，黜聪明，离形去知。”——《庄子》

道书一角画着上一代云间子读经时常坐的小椅：月弧靠背托住肩颈，深青坐垫只留一人方寸。现任云间子依样制成，偶尔读至无字处，也会就此闭目片刻。

效果：可供一人用餐、研读或休憩的舒适座椅。</description>
    <thingClass>Building</thingClass><designationCategory>Ideology</designationCategory>
    <graphicData><texPath>Yunjianzi/Buildings/Bedroom/Chair</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass><shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType><drawSize>(1.05,1.05)</drawSize></graphicData>
    <size>(1,1)</size><altitudeLayer>Building</altitudeLayer><passability>PassThroughOnly</passability><pathCost>30</pathCost><fillPercent>0.35</fillPercent>
    <costList><Milira_SplendidSteel>45</Milira_SplendidSteel></costList>
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>220</MaxHitPoints><Beauty>14</Beauty><WorkToBuild>850</WorkToBuild><Mass>7</Mass><Flammability>0</Flammability><Comfort>0.85</Comfort></statBases>
    <building><isSittable>true</isSittable><paintable>false</paintable></building>
    <replaceTags><li>Chair</li></replaceTags><uiOrder>3972</uiOrder>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="FurnitureBase">
    <defName>YJZ_Bedroom_SmallTable</defName>
    <label>灵玉小方桌</label>
    <description>“治大国若烹小鲜。”——《道德经》

道书生活札记中反复出现这张小桌，恰容一餐、一卷与一盏清茶。上一代云间子没有写它有何玄妙，只说真正决定日子如何过下去的，往往是这些细小而不可轻忽的事。

效果：紧凑的餐桌兼聚会点，可供相邻角色用餐、阅读与社交。</description>
    <thingClass>Building</thingClass><designationCategory>Ideology</designationCategory>
    <graphicData><texPath>Yunjianzi/Buildings/Bedroom/SmallTable</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass><shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType><drawSize>(1.08,1.08)</drawSize></graphicData>
    <size>(1,1)</size><altitudeLayer>Building</altitudeLayer><passability>PassThroughOnly</passability><pathCost>42</pathCost><fillPercent>0.4</fillPercent>
    <surfaceType>Eat</surfaceType><socialPropernessMatters>true</socialPropernessMatters><canOverlapZones>false</canOverlapZones>
    <costList><Milira_SplendidSteel>50</Milira_SplendidSteel></costList>
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>250</MaxHitPoints><Beauty>16</Beauty><WorkToBuild>1000</WorkToBuild><Mass>9</Mass><Flammability>0</Flammability></statBases>
    <comps><li><compClass>CompGatherSpot</compClass></li></comps>
    <replaceTags><li>Table</li></replaceTags><uiOrder>3973</uiOrder>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="FurnitureBase">
    <defName>YJZ_Bedroom_Wardrobe</defName>
    <label>云纹衣柜</label>
    <description>“知足不辱，知止不殆。”——《道德经》

道书起居图中的衣柜没有洞天，只够收好一袭道袍与几件行装。恒净灵路驱去尘气，也让卧榻周围少些杂乱；上一代在旁题道，长生路远，真正需要带走的东西并不多。

效果：作为卧室设施，小幅提高附近床铺的舒适度；每张床只能连接一座。</description>
    <thingClass>Building</thingClass><designationCategory>Ideology</designationCategory>
    <graphicData><texPath>Yunjianzi/Buildings/Bedroom/Wardrobe</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass><shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType><drawSize>(1.15,1.15)</drawSize></graphicData>
    <size>(1,1)</size><altitudeLayer>Building</altitudeLayer><passability>PassThroughOnly</passability><pathCost>45</pathCost><fillPercent>0.55</fillPercent>
    <costList><Milira_SplendidSteel>70</Milira_SplendidSteel></costList>
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>320</MaxHitPoints><Beauty>20</Beauty><WorkToBuild>1400</WorkToBuild><Mass>14</Mass><Flammability>0</Flammability></statBases>
    <placeWorkers><li>PlaceWorker_ShowFacilitiesConnections</li></placeWorkers>
    <comps><li Class="CompProperties_Facility"><statOffsets><Comfort>0.05</Comfort></statOffsets><maxDistance>6</maxDistance><maxSimultaneous>1</maxSimultaneous></li></comps>
    <uiOrder>3974</uiOrder>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="BookcaseBase">
    <defName>YJZ_Bedroom_WallBookcase</defName>
    <label>五卷悬书阁</label>
    <description>“为学日益，为道日损。”——《道德经》

道书所绘悬阁只容五卷，故每留一书都须有所取舍。现任云间子依图让旧纸与新式辉钢一同守住知识；书愈少，反而愈知道自己仍缺哪一卷。

效果：贴墙安置的小型书架，只能存放少量书籍；能够保护藏书，并辅助同室研究。</description>
    <designationCategory>Ideology</designationCategory>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yunjianzi/Buildings/Bedroom/WallBookcase</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass><shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType>
        <drawOffsetNorth>(0,0.1,1.05)</drawOffsetNorth><drawOffsetSouth>(0,0.1,-1.05)</drawOffsetSouth>
        <drawOffsetWest>(-1.05,0.1,0)</drawOffsetWest><drawOffsetEast>(1.05,0.1,0)</drawOffsetEast>
        <drawSize>(1.08,1.08)</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <size>(1,1)</size><stuffCategories Inherit="False"/><costList><Milira_SplendidSteel>55</Milira_SplendidSteel></costList>
    <altitudeLayer>BuildingOnTop</altitudeLayer><passability>Standable</passability><pathCost>0</pathCost>
    <terrainAffordanceNeeded IsNull="True"/><defaultPlacingRot>South</defaultPlacingRot><overrideMinifiedRot>North</overrideMinifiedRot>
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>260</MaxHitPoints><Beauty>18</Beauty><WorkToBuild>1100</WorkToBuild><Mass>9</Mass><Flammability>0</Flammability></statBases>
    <building>
      <isEdifice>false</isEdifice><isAttachment>true</isAttachment>
      <maxItemsInCell>5</maxItemsInCell>
      <bookendGraphicEast><texPath>Yunjianzi/Buildings/Bedroom/WallBookcase_Bookend_east</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass><addTopAltitudeBias>true</addTopAltitudeBias><drawSize>(1,1)</drawSize></bookendGraphicEast>
      <bookendGraphicNorth><texPath>Yunjianzi/Buildings/Bedroom/WallBookcase_Bookend_north</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass><addTopAltitudeBias>true</addTopAltitudeBias><drawSize>(1,1)</drawSize></bookendGraphicNorth>
    </building>
      <placeWorkers><li>Placeworker_AttachedToWall</li><li>PlaceWorker_DrawLinesToResearchTablesInRoom</li></placeWorkers>
    <uiIconScale>0.62</uiIconScale><uiOrder>3975</uiOrder>
  </ThingDef>
</Defs>
